  "prefLabel": "Rev 407.03 Residency Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 407.03 Residency Requirements. The applicant shall have been a resident of the municipality on April 1 in the tax year in which the surviving spouse tax credit is claimed.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 400) #9309, eff 10-30-08; ss by #12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 406.03)",
